
Package: simInference
Title: Simulation-Based Statistical Inference for Teaching
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Innocent", "Abaa", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "iga100@juniata.edu")
Description: Teaching-oriented functions for simulation-based hypothesis tests,
    bootstrap confidence intervals, and chi-square simulation tests.
    Supports data-frame column expressions and ordinary vectors.
